 a collision while trying to gain places, putting him out along with Hans Binder and Noritake Takahara.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":20},{"lap":6,"text":"A marshal and photographer were killed by debris following a collision involving Gilles Villeneuve's Ferrari and Ronnie Peterson's Tyrrell P34 on lap six.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":18},{"lap":73,"text":"Hunt went on and capped off the season with a comfortable win, whereas Laffite ran out of fuel on the last lap, handing over second to Reutemann and allowing Patrick Depailler to complete the podium.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":4}]}